# VnPy 模块开发规范

## 模块结构标准

### 标准VnPy模块结构
```
vnpy_modulename/
├── __init__.py                 # 模块包初始化
├── CHANGELOG.md               # 变更日志
├── LICENSE                    # 许可证
├── README.md                  # 模块说明
└── vnpy_modulename/           # 主要代码目录
    ├── __init__.py           # 导出主要类和常量
    ├── engine.py             # 核心引擎逻辑
    ├── template.py           # 模板基类
    ├── ui/                   # 用户界面
    │   ├── __init__.py
    │   └── widget.py
    └── locale/               # 国际化文件
        ├── __init__.py
        └── zh_CN.po
```

## 核心组件开发

### 1. 应用类 (App Class)
```python
from pathlib import Path
from vnpy.trader.app import BaseApp
from .engine import ModuleNameEngine

APP_NAME = "ModuleName"

class ModuleNameApp(BaseApp):
    """模块应用类"""
    
    app_name: str = APP_NAME
    app_module: str = __module__
    app_path: Path = Path(__file__).parent
    display_name: str = "模块显示名称"
    engine_class: type[ModuleNameEngine] = ModuleNameEngine
    widget_name: str = "ModuleWidget"
    icon_name: str = str(app_path.joinpath("ui", "module.ico"))
```

### 2. 引擎类 (Engine Class)
```python
from vnpy.trader.engine import BaseEngine, MainEngine
from vnpy.event import EventEngine

class ModuleNameEngine(BaseEngine):
    """模块引擎类"""
    
    def __init__(self, main_engine: MainEngine, event_engine: EventEngine):
        """构造函数"""
        super().__init__(main_engine, event_engine, APP_NAME)
        
        # 初始化模块状态
        self.active = False
        
    def start(self):
        """启动模块"""
        self.write_log("模块启动")
        self.active = True
        
    def stop(self):
        """停止模块"""
        self.write_log("模块停止")
        self.active = False
```

### 3. 模板类 (Template Class)
```python
from abc import ABC, abstractmethod
from vnpy.trader.object import BarData, TickData

class ModuleTemplate(ABC):
    """模块模板基类"""
    
    def __init__(self):
        """构造函数"""
        self.inited = False
        self.trading = False
        
    @abstractmethod
    def on_init(self):
        """初始化回调"""
        pass
        
    @abstractmethod
    def on_start(self):
        """启动回调"""
        pass
        
    @abstractmethod
    def on_stop(self):
        """停止回调"""
        pass
```

